OL,3,GNEWSAA12 closed in both directions
OL,4,Aafter pedestrian hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A12 has been closed in both
OL,7,Fdirections at Colchester after a
OL,8,Fcollision between a car and a
OL,9,Fpedestrian.
OL,11,FNational Highways said it happened
OL,12,Fsometime before 17:43 GMT and both
OL,13,Fcarriageways were shut between junction
OL,14,F28 for Colchester United's stadium and
OL,15,Fjunction 26 for Eight Ash Green and
OL,16,FTollgate.
OL,18,FThe roads agency said Essex Police and
OL,19,Fambulance crews had been sent to the
OL,20,Fscene and the A12 was likely to remain
OL,21,Fclosed throughout the evening.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
