OL,3,GNEWSAA12 closed in both directions
OL,4,Aafter pedestrian hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiversions through Colchester have been
OL,7,Fput in place and drivers stuck in
OL,8,Ftraffic on the A12 were being told to
OL,9,Fwait for instructions from police
OL,10,Fbefore moving.
